  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Lemon.png/revision/latest?cb=20240219033200\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Lemon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lemon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Lemon</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/crops-3568\" title=\"Crops\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Crop</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 66</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 1 to 93</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  1 d 6 h</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 18</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Lemon Tree</span><span title=\"Lemon tree(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/lemon-tree-10425\" title=\"Lemon Tree\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lemon Tree\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Default: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 26</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 18</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Lemons</b> are fruit <a href=\"/wiki/crops-3568\" title=\"Crops\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">crops</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 66. They grow on <a href=\"/wiki/lemon-tree-10425\" title=\"Lemon Tree\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lemon trees</a> and can be harvested four times.\n</p><p>They are mostly used as ingredients in drinks and sauces but also as a scent for candles.\n</p><p>Like all crops, they are stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/silo-2654\" title=\"Silo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">silo</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Harvesting lemons</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/df/Lemon_Tree.png/revision/latest?cb=20180217163032\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Lemon tree\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lemon tree\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Lemon tree</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The first harvest gives two lemons, the second one three, and the other two four. After the third harvest the tree wilts.\n</p><p>After the first time the tree wilts, tapping on it will show a pop-out menu consisting of two options, a <a href=\"/wiki/saw-2924\" title=\"Saw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">saw</a>, and a sign with an exclamition mark. If you place the sign, another player can tap on it, and revive the tree for one more harvest. After that, the tree wilts, and the only way to get rid of it is by using a saw.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Selling lemons</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/09/Roadside_Shop.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028143054\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Roadside shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Roadside shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Roadside shop</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li>Lemons can be sold or bought for a maximum price of 936 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> for 10 fruit.</li>\n<li>Buying a lemon tree costs 670 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>.</li>\n<li>Given all 13 lemons are collected during the four harvests, the batch can be sold for 1,216 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>, thus giving a profit of 546 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> per tree.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Using lemons</b></span></h3>\n<p>Lemons are used to make the following <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/olive-dip-28429\" title=\"Olive dip\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Olive dip\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/lemon-curd-10558\" title=\"Lemon curd\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lemon curd\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/green-smoothie-11418\" title=\"Green smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Green smoothie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/olive-dip-28429\" title=\"Olive Dip\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Olive Dip</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/lemon-curd-10558\" title=\"Lemon Curd\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lemon Curd</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/green-smoothie-11418\" title=\"Green Smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Green Smoothie</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Lemon.png/revision/latest?cb=20240219033200\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lemon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Lemon.png/revision/latest?cb=20240219033200\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lemon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x2</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Lemon.png/revision/latest?cb=20240219033200\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lemon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x1</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 66\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 66\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 66\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/pasta-salad-19454\" title=\"Pasta salad\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pasta salad\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/grilled-asparagus-35812\" title=\"Grilled asparagus\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Grilled asparagus\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/lemon-essential-oil-36028\" title=\"Lemon essential oil\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lemon essential oil\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/pasta-salad-19454\" title=\"Pasta Salad\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pasta Salad</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/grilled-asparagus-35812\" title=\"Grilled Asparagus\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Grilled Asparagus</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/lemon-essential-oil-36028\" title=\"Lemon Essential Oil\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lemon Essential Oil</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Lemon.png/revis